        <label>slightly like weight gain</label>
        <labelShortAdj>weight-slight-like</labelShortAdj>
        <description>Carriers of this gene understand the appeal of the larger form. They appreciate the softness that comes with carrying extra weight and prefer to be heavier themselves.</description>
