        <labelShortAdj>weight-like</labelShortAdj>
        <description>Carriers of this gene are true fat admirers. They would like nothing more than to be fat and will be quite upset if they're not.</description>
        <iconPath>Genes/Opinion/WOLike</iconPath>
        <geneClass>SwellGlow.SGGene</geneClass>
